Dear Pia,

Thank you for the 2027 offer. We have benchmarked it, and +6% is clearly abov=
e what we see in the market (+2 to +4% on comparable lanes). We therefore pro=
pose the following:

- an increase of +3% on all 19 lanes, e.g. Rotterdam - Shanghai at EUR 1,185 =
per TEU (instead of 1,219)
- in return, a volume commitment of 1,800 TEU for 2027 in total, versus a 202=
6 forecast of about 1,650 TEU

We will give you our formal answer by 18 November as requested. Please let us=
 know whether your pricing team can work with this.

Best regards, Tom

